; Steal This Pedal factory bank — slot 5
; MUNICIPAL LUNG
; POT0 = resonant length / pitch
; POT1 = decay
; POT2 = material brightness
; Wet-only output.
; Spin Computer adaptation: RAW renamed RAW_TAP (RAW is an assembler directive).

TUNNEL      MEM 29000
RAW_TAP         EQU REG0
DARK        EQU REG1
BRIGHT      EQU REG2
INV_TONE    EQU REG3
LEFT        EQU REG4

; First moving tap: short metallic pipe through long concrete cavity.
LDAX POT0
SOF 0.145, 0.004
AND $7FFF00
WRAX ADDR_PTR, 0.0
CLR
RMPA 1.0
WRAX RAW_TAP, 0.0

; Low-pass the recirculation, then POT2 blends dark and raw materials.
LDAX RAW_TAP
RDFX DARK, 0.14
WRAX DARK, 0.0
LDAX POT2
SOF -1.0, 0.999
WRAX INV_TONE, 0.0
LDAX DARK
MULX INV_TONE
WRAX BRIGHT, 0.0
LDAX RAW_TAP
MULX POT2
RDAX BRIGHT, 1.0
WRAX BRIGHT, 1.0
SOF 0.82, 0.0
WRAX LEFT, 0.0

; Regenerative comb injection.  The fixed 0.86 ceiling protects the loop.
LDAX BRIGHT
MULX POT1
SOF 0.86, 0.0
RDAX ADCL, 0.33
RDAX ADCR, 0.33
WRA TUNNEL, 0.0

; Left is the main resonator.
LDAX LEFT
WRAX DACL, 0.0

; Right uses a non-integer-related cavity length for concrete stereo slap.
LDAX POT0
SOF 0.207, 0.011
AND $7FFF00
WRAX ADDR_PTR, 0.0
CLR
RMPA 0.72
RDAX LEFT, 0.38
WRAX DACR, 0.0
